 "finalMessage": "Fixed the browser-history depth stamping bug when `history.length` is capped.\n\nBug: `saveCurrentDepth()` (src/routers/history.ts) stamped any entry arriving without a `_depth` using `history.length - 1`. Once the browser caps session history (50 in Chromium/Firefox), `length` stops growing, so an external `history.pushState(null, \"\", \"/#anchor\")` followed by `popstate` got the same depth as the pr"
